<title>KENYA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT S.AFRICA BY TWO WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT S.AFRICA BY TWO WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka beat South Africa by two wickets in their one-day match in the Kenyan centenary four-nation cricket tournament at the Nairobi Club on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>South Africa 169 all out in 42 overs.</p>
<p>Sri Lanka 170 for eight wickets in 40.4 overs.</p>
</text>
